#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:4
#: 8bc805ed83eb4eac9856e3dc50ad445d
msgid "Setting the Aircraft Up for Tuning"
msgstr "为调参设置飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:6
#: 6f27881157ce4f9693d388044f7ca547
msgid ""
"The following parameters should be set correctly based on the "
"specifications of your aircraft. Each one impacts the quality of the "
"tuning process."
msgstr "以下参数应根据您飞行器的规格正确设置。每个参数都会影响调参过程的质量。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:10
#: 4c19eca5dde048d69e769ea62af07dc6
msgid "Battery setting"
msgstr "电池设置"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:11
#: f3658322cc474283931c8765ad10161e
msgid ""
"It is very important to ensure that the thrust curve of your VTOL motors "
"is as linear as possible. A linear thrust curve means that changes in the"
" actual thrust produced by a motor is directly proportional to the thrust"
" being demanded by ArduPilot. If your thrust curve is badly non-linear "
"then you will never produce a good tune, and in some cases may end up "
"with such a bad tune that your vehicle can become completely unstable and"
" crash."
msgstr ""
"确保 VTOL 电机的推力曲线尽可能线性至关重要。线性推力曲线意味着电机实际产生的推力变化与 ArduPilot "
"要求的推力成正比。如果推力曲线严重非线性，您将永远无法产生良好的调参结果，在某些情况下甚至可能产生如此糟糕的调参，以至于飞行器变得完全不稳定并坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:19
#: 21787cfe19cb4d7788119410745eb976
msgid "There are 3 common causes of a non-linear thrust curve."
msgstr "推力曲线非线性有 3 种常见原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:21
#: b351013732044fbe9bfb67d4d4c4348e
msgid "voltage sag as throttle is increased."
msgstr "增大油门时电压下降。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:22
#: 5d8e5925f238416db2200319dd404660
msgid ""
"incorrect end-point setup in the PWM range you use to your ESCs (see "
"\"Motors setup\" below)"
msgstr "ESC 使用的 PWM 范围端点设置不正确（参见下方「电机设置」）"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:23
#: 25e7fe5b16b1411aa70fad6710bfc7c2
msgid ""
"non-linearity in the thrust produced by your propeller, ESC and motor "
"combination"
msgstr "螺旋桨、ESC和电机组合产生的推力固有非线性"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:25
#: 214a452ae6834bec949206430d7419ac
msgid ""
"Start with setting up the voltage range to cope with voltage sag. "
"Parameters used to linearise your motor thrust curve."
msgstr "首先设置电压范围以应对电压下降。用于线性化电机推力曲线的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:28
#: 0d6ac88a8ac94dc782ddd7d453c84bc6
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX <MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` should be set to the maximum "
"voltage of your batteries, e.g. 4.2v x No. Cells for standard LiPos, or "
"as appropriate if using a different battery type."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX <MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` "
"应设置为电池的最高电压，例如标准LiPo的4.2V乘以电池节数，或根据其他电池类型适当设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:29
#: 34b520bb33c24c45b67715ddf7629b05
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN <MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` should be set to the minimum "
"voltage of your batteries, e.g. 3.3v x No. Cells for standard LiPos, or "
"as appropriate if using a different battery type ."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN <MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` "
"应设置为电池的最低电压，例如标准LiPo的3.3V乘以电池节数，或根据其他电池类型适当设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:30
#: 502d1a6dad574f9e8f89da8746d28d1d
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_OPTIONS<MOT_OPTIONS>` = 0 (default). The default is to use sag "
"compensated voltage for the above and during tuning computations. It can "
"be set to 1 to use raw voltage instead of sag compensated voltage, which "
"may improve tuning results for light vehicles."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_OPTIONS<MOT_OPTIONS>` = "
"0（默认）。默认使用抗压降补偿电压进行上述及调参计算。可设置为1以使用原始电压代替抗压降补偿电压，这可能改善轻型飞行器的调参效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:32
#: 92fdbf1628904383bbe8ac136d206b7f
msgid ""
"Next setup the thrust expo. If you are setting up a professional aircraft"
" then you should invest in a thrust stand so you can accurately measure "
"the true thrust for your motor/ESC/propeller combination as you vary the "
"throttle. Then you will adjust the expo value along with the endpoints "
"(given by motors setup below) so that the thrust between the endpoints is"
" as linear as possible. Do not trust manufacturer data for the thrust "
"curve as they are frequently inaccurate. See :ref:`motor-thrust-scaling` "
"for details on thrust scaling."
msgstr ""
"接下来设置推力 expo。如果您在设置专业飞行器，应投资购买推力台架，以便在改变油门时准确测量电机/ESC/螺旋桨组合的真实推力。然后您将调整 "
"expo "
"值以及端点（由下面的电机设置给出），使端点之间的推力尽可能线性。不要相信制造商的推力曲线数据，因为它们经常不准确。有关推力缩放的详情，请参阅 "
":ref:`motor-thrust-scaling`。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:38
#: 9ce68a72fba84286b6e64c6db5f8d900
msgid ""
"If you are setting up a hobby grade vehicle then you can use the graph "
"below to estimate the correct :ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO <MOT_THST_EXPO>` value "
"for your aircraft."
msgstr "如果您在安装爱好级飞行器，可以使用下图来估算您飞行器的正确 :ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO <MOT_THST_EXPO>` 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:40
#: f17c0eeadfaf4ba78d39d5958730d396
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO <MOT_THST_EXPO>`: 0.55 for 5 inch props, 0.65 for 10 "
"inch props, 0.75 for 20 inch props  (or larger). This parameter should be"
" derived by thrust stand measurements for best results (don’t trust "
"manufacturer data)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO "
"<MOT_THST_EXPO>`：5英寸桨为0.55，10英寸桨为0.65，20英寸桨（或更大）为0.75。为获得最佳结果，该参数应通过推力台测量获得（不要相信厂家数据）。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:46
#: ac979fc90ef54235b226a2577d036f13
msgid "Motors setup"
msgstr "电机设置"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:48
#: 01b2c58d148c4451a58ffddd92d95555
msgid ""
"The motor parameters define the PWM output range sent to the ESCs. This "
"is critical to ensure that the entire range of throttle values used in "
"flight is within the linear range of your propulsion system."
msgstr "电机参数定义发送给 ESC 的 PWM 输出范围。这对于确保飞行中使用的全部油门值范围在推进系统的线性范围内至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:53
#: 39490c3a026541f1ae9e8a4588f8468e
msgid "Parameters used to define the output range sent to the ESC."
msgstr "用于定义发送给ESC的输出范围的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:55
#: ad3819cff38f438ea2875a8420bec5a1
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX <MOT_PWM_MAX>`: Check ESC manual for fixed range or "
"2000us"
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX <MOT_PWM_MAX>`：查阅ESC手册的固定范围或2000us"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:56
#: d921d28ae08643429bd7809b38d1cf39
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>`: Check ESC manual for fixed range or "
"1000us"
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>`：查阅ESC手册的固定范围或1000us"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:57
#: 7740718dbb004505af386d006e17f6ea
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>`: use the :ref:`motor test feature "
"<connect-escs-and-motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>` to determine a "
"value which will reliably start the motors spinning at a low rpm as an "
"indication of the armed state."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>`：使用 :ref:`电机测试功能 <connect-escs-and-"
"motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>` 确定一个能可靠使电机在低转速下开始旋转的值，以表示解锁状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:58
#: 138713cefa424be0afc514787e61c93b
msgid ":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MAX <MOT_SPIN_MAX>`: 0.95"
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MAX <MOT_SPIN_MAX>`：0.95"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:59
#: 4161c0d047af48f9bfc46263246dd6c6
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>`: use the :ref:`motor test feature "
"<connect-escs-and-motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>` and motor test "
"data, if available, to set the lower range of linear thrust. The default "
"value is usually adequate for hobby uses."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>`：使用 :ref:`电机测试功能 <connect-escs-and-"
"motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>` "
"及（如有）电机测试数据，设置线性推力的下限范围。默认值通常对爱好用途已足够。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:60
#: e654c95c7dcf42008066f1459efa0f85
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>`: 0.25 or below the expected actual"
" hover thrust percentage (lower is safe)"
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>`：0.25或低于预期实际悬停推力百分比（偏低更安全）"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:63
#: 0f581f70b2ef42b9a4060ee9b29cd6d7
msgid "PID Controller Initial Setup"
msgstr "PID控制器初始设置"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:65
#: 468c7af8b65a434a9e4902434f531d2d
msgid ""
"The settings below are meant to get your PID controller acceleration and "
"filter settings into the right approximate range for your vehicle. These "
"parameters are critical to the tuning process. The PID controller default"
" values for axis P/D/I values are usually safe for first test hovers of "
"most vehicles."
msgstr "以下设置旨在将您的PID控制器加速度和滤波器设置调整到适合您飞行器的大致合理范围。这些参数对调参过程至关重要。各轴PID控制器P/D/I值的默认参数通常对大多数飞行器的首次悬停测试是安全的。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.rst:70
